yway  as they just want to feel safe so she  also adds I'd rather call you crazy than  admit that I can lift this car or melt  your insides with my laser eyes later  during a conversation with Luke Jessica  again says she's not hiding but adds  she's not advertising either and Luke  points out that being a hero just puts a  target on your back in other Marvel  references when Jessica recommends  another private investigator to Luke  Cage she named drops Angela del Toro aka  white tiger who appears in the daredevil  comics in episode 8 wh IH world news  appears on TV to report on the hostage  standoff  whi H is a Marvel regular and it's TV  news stories have appeared in daredevil  agents of shield Avengers age of Ultron  the Incredible Hulk and I'm  - and there's another nod to Avengers  age of Ultron when Jessica says go to  sleep when she takes out a guy who's  attacking her because kilgrave's mind  controlling him in age of Ultron Scarlet  Witch hexes Bruce banners mind sending  him on a rampage as the Hulk and Iron  Man tries to bring him back by hammering  his head while repeating the words go to  sleep and in Episode six Jessica Scott's  at the loanshark circs thinks he's  called I can which is funny as Carl  Icahn is a real-life investor who once  tried to take over Marvel also Keebler  circus pops up on a sign behind Wendy in  Episode nine qiblah Circus was later  known as a Tybalt circus and Clint  Barton aka Hawkeye and the Hulk  among others were members at various  points and in episode 10 we hear that  hopes aborted fetus with kilgrave's DNA  was sent to hammond labs for testing  which could be the same hammond labs  from the comics that Robbie Baldwin aka  speedball interned out now what other  Easter eggs references and callbacks did  you spot in Jessica Jones and which are  your favorites and I'd also love to know  what you saw to the series as a whole I  look forward to reading your comments  below and thanks in advance for sharing  and liking this v